      {
        "id": "tb-design-concepts",
        "moduleId": "m-programming-model",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材的设计思想：五个术语的分工",
        "markdown": "Storm 对流式计算做了概念抽象，主要术语包括 Streams、Spouts、Bolts、Topology 和 Stream Groupings。教材的设计思想部分正是围绕这五个概念展开：Streams 描述数据本身，Spouts 描述数据的来源，Bolts 描述如何处理，Topology 描述整体如何连成一张图，Stream Groupings 描述元组如何在组件之间分发。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
